<p>aye momino hussain pa shiddat ki pyaas hai<br />
jangal me fatema ka pisar be hawaas hai<br />
yaawar na koi hai na koi bhaai paas hai<br />
laashe uthaake laane se moula udaas hai</p>

<p>lu chal rahi thi pyaas thi waqt-e zawaal tha<br />
be chain ran me dhoop se zehra ka laal tha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye momino qayaal karo dil me tum zara<br />
wo pyaas aur wo zaqm wo sehraa-e karbala<br />
wo saamne ki dhoop wo zaqmo'n ka mu khula<br />
wo lu se phat- tha zaqmo'n ka wo dard wo jafaa</p>

<p>kya dukh uthaaye fatema ke noor-e ain ne<br />
aafat sahi tumhaare liye ye hussain ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aada se keh rahe the ye moula ghareeb hoo'n<br />
allah ke habeeb ka yaaro habeeb hoo'n<br />
ek dam me dam nikalta hai ab anqareeb hoo'n<br />
zaqmi hoo'n begunaah hoo'n aafat naseeb hoo'n</p>

<p>tum jiske kalma go ho mai uska nawaasa hoo'n<br />
paani pilaake zibha karo yaaro pyaasa hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehte the ye hussain ke ek zalzalaa huwa<br />
saatho'n tabaq zameen ke hile aasmaa'n hila<br />
naagaah aayi fatema zehra ki ye sadaa<br />
waqt-e- namaaz-e asr bhi nazdeek aagaya</p>

<p>tifli me jo kiya tha wo waada wafaa karo<br />
jhuk kar hussain shukr ka sajda adaa karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jisdam suni hussain ne zehra ki ye sadaa<br />
qof-e qudaa se kaanp gaye sar se taa bapaa<br />
ghash khaake farsh-e zee'n se gire wa musibataa<br />
har zaqm se nikalne lagi shukr ki sadaa</p>

<p>sajde me sar tha dhyaan tha us kaar-o- saaz par<br />
rote the shaah sar dhare qaak-e niyaaz par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>isdam laee'n ne door se dekha ye maajra<br />
shimr-e laee'n ko paas bulaakar ye tab kaha<br />
sibt-e rasool qaak pa behosh hai padaa<br />
kya dekhta hai waqt phir aisa na aayega</p>

<p>zaqmo'n se choor hai tan-e at'har hussain ka<br />
haa'n jald jaake kaat le ab sar hussain ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye mu(s)dda sunke aagaya laalach me wo laee'n<br />
qanjar pakad ke aaya qareeb-e- imaam-e dee'n<br />
chaathi pa zaanu rakh ke chadhaayi jo aastee'n<br />
tab noor-e chashm-e fatema ne aankhe'n khol di'n</p>

<p>dekha to koi dost hai ne ghamgusaar hai<br />
qanjar gale pa seene pa qatil sawaar hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>farmaaya shah ne koun hai tu aye sitam shiyaar<br />
kyu mere zaqmi seene pa aakar huwa sawaar<br />
qanjar mere gale pa jo rakhta hai baar baar<br />
samjha hai kis qataa pa mujhe tu gunaah gaar</p>

<p>deta hai ranj rooh-e risaalat panaah ko<br />
kyu zibha karne aaya hai mujh begunaah ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ispar bhi kuch na dil me laee'n ke asar huwa<br />
qanjar se kaatne laga mazloom ka gala<br />
uswaqt aayi fatema zehra ki ye sada<br />
aye shimr mera laal hai be jurm-o be qataa</p>

<p>ye zulm mustafa ke nawaase ke halq par<br />
qanjar na pher bhuke ke pyase ke halq par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mai ne bade dukhoun se hai paala hussain ko<br />
naahaq tu zibha karta hai pyaasa hussain ko<br />
lillah na zere tegh tu tadpa hussain ko<br />
phat te hai zaqm hoti hai eezaa hussain ko</p>

<p>zaalim kaleja phat-ta hai mujh dil malool ka<br />
bachhe ko mere chod de sadqa rasool ka<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>